message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below, and cite the models it runs (StarDist, HoVer-Net, Segment Anything, MedSAM)."
title: "Histopathology Annotation MCP"
abstract: "An MCP server for annotating histopathology and other images from AI assistants: StarDist nuclei, Segment Anything and MedSAM outlines, slide quality checks, stain normalization and whole-slide analysis, with COCO, YOLO and QuPath GeoJSON exports."
